                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink/50">
            Recovery timelines vary by individual. Your surgical team will provide personalized guidance. Most surgeons recommend waiting 7-14 days before long-haul flights, with a fitness-to-fly certificate.
          </p>
